      "text": "1. devices\nTujuan: daftar alat\nAnalogi: inventaris alat klinik\n\nKolom inti:\n- id\n- device_code\n- name\n- mqtt_topic\n- status\n- last_seen_at\n- firmware_version\n- created_at\n- updated_at",
