      "text": "4. sensor_readings\nTujuan: data mentah dari hardware\nAnalogi: hasil lab asli\n\nKolom inti:\n- id\n- device_id\n- subject_id nullable\n- recorded_at\n- received_at\n- ph\n- fructosamine\n- salivary_glucose\n- raw_payload JSONB\n- quality_flag\n- created_at\n\nCatatan:\nini disimpan walau model AI belum jadi.",
